  "postText": "<p><HTML><HEAD><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\"></HEAD><body></p>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/diRexLQ619KCHAtHUux9xG8Un26ULGR0LkKakCcw9XjXO4FllFx3LOtaFBfo7SGImPrXMJdts59CTuIvX09ELsFZyctpsBfT7BuiYtk2PiVvSz0clnr3tHlLVD9k6T72yviIn3QciMHcTO2DaBHMXrMt3O50UUxeCY5vq26CYB0f9P2Z1WtjyXrsWEG2C8CIl3iqIKhs\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/288/3791ce7f850266382ca298111f073f75..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">こんにちは～！！！！！！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">こさめです</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">今日もソロチェキ&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">寝</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ソロチェキ</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">みたいな</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/6GL4RuuLinMr34N5VH04gVPowrItgxLAsGu1ikH54RhArWc5tjRDTcgPq90KR43TAAIKCWDMCln5DKxBZhOkW6NRWKJ8IeBZAFseUAgh5du0qlfA6u62YTXZAi7ELEJde4Dr6JoeEz04icrh0sORS7ofnLPUzBPFoVZ6ZrFlXgrE6PcEDZ87Uth4fdnB0Brjxp1Qkd2T\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/288/0e265a373687d953c3738e052f85859f..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">今日これ完成させたんだけど</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">かわいー！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">水色塗るの楽しかった</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">こさめになってから</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">本当に水色好きになったなーって思う</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">それに皆似合うって言ってくれるし！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">早くみんなの元にソロチェキ届けたいな～</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">という気持ちで心込めて1枚1枚描いてますっ</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">なんか謎に色んなことで忙しいけど</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">全部頑張るよ！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">でも睡眠は大事かも</div>\n<p></body></HTML></p>\n",
